  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三关（前）\n11:11 A.M. 天气/小雨\n龙门中城区，三窗仔，木禾仓库外，"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "大致侦查完毕。我们的观察点够隐蔽，仓库四周空无一人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "大量堆砌的建材，荒废的建筑工地，拖动和摆放的痕迹很明显。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "可以肯定整合运动已经布置了埋伏。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "老陈，你的线人是阿发。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "......是。所以你还是听到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "我已经尽力不去听了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "我认识他很久很久，到今天为止至少十年。我不可能听不出来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "你是什么时候把他发展成线人的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "他一年多前就感染了，从他营生的酒吧里忽然消失，留下他每天擦得干干净净的酒杯在那落灰。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "可能更早。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "至少这个，你应该告诉我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "可能要下雨了。立刻开始排查，把敌人从埋伏点轰出来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "——唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "来不及。他没剩下多少血可流。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "我去吸引火力，把所有整合运动都引出来。你们包围他们，结束这场战斗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "很危险。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "这样做是最快的。这一次，你可以信任我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "我一直都信任你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "按星熊督察说的部署。动作快。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
      "text": "是！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "星熊，我准备好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "这才像话！我会把所有埋伏点都毁掉，把他们全都逼出来。给我三分钟。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "乱来，你要独自作战三分钟，毁掉所有埋伏点？别被冲昏头脑！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "如果你出了任何差错，我会立刻指挥进攻！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "不。给我三分钟。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "......只有三分钟。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "我去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
